Ira
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 90 DEAL NUKUP
NUKUP 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
NUKUP 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
NUKUP 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE NUKUP NUKUP
AND
    OR
        SRC Rank K
        DESTSRC Rank equal
    DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK NUKUP NUKUP
OR
    AND
        SRCSTACK Suit alternate_color
        DEST Rank K
    DEST Empty
DRAW
PILE ALL NUKUP Size > 0
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
